{"schemaVersion":1,"objectId":"fund002053","records":[{"id":"1802140952","objectId":"fund002053","title":"人形机器人，是跨年主线吗?","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of002053,1802140952.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 20:03:48","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":74,"commentCount":3,"content":"人形机器人，是跨年主线吗?","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":3,"body":"complete","reportedComments":3,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of002053","comments":[{"id":"9984097899","text":"个人观点：从资金面看，人形机器人板块波动较大，涨得快跌得也快，适合风险偏好较高的人。它不一定是“最稳”的主线，但一定是“最刺激”的弹性主线。不论玩什么基金，时刻要牢记：知进知退，知买知卖，以提高生存率。宁愿100次错的止盈，也不要100次对的止损，每一次盈亏都是你命运的因果。留得青山在不怕没柴烧。懂不懂知退、知卖哪是你自己的事。因为，你才是钱的主人。","at":"2026-11-26 20:17:44","replyTo":""},{"id":"9984099418","text":"小心明天人形机器人来个光头大阳线。试目以待。[上涨][上涨][上涨]","at":"2026-11-26 20:22:08","replyTo":""},{"id":"9984105038","text":"玩基金要五看，一看政策；二看资金（量能持续性）；三看指标（看图说话）；四看基金（弃弱择强，波段操作）；五看个人执行买卖纪律。缺一不可。","at":"2026-11-26 20:37:29","replyTo":""}]},{"id":"1801952488","objectId":"fund002053","title":"果然，没坚持住，创业板新低，机器人也一样，破位了。","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of002053,1801952488.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 14:03:24","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":37,"commentCount":0,"content":"果然，没坚持住，创业板新低，机器人也一样，破位了。","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"complete","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"of002053","comments":[]},{"id":"1801630253","objectId":"fund002053","title":"又是高开低走，到午盘再看有没有反弹。","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,of002053,1801630253.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 09:41:35","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":48,"commentCount":1,"content":"又是高开低走，到午盘再看有没有反弹。","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":1,"body":"complete","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTr